{"id":"2fb2d5f37e2f74bd","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-zfc-cartesian-closed-class.md","title":"ZFC Cartesian Closed Class","display":"df-zfc-cartesian-closed-class — ZFC Cartesian Closed Class","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-cartesian-closed-class","aliases":["58-df-zfc-cartesian-closed-class"],"display":"df-zfc-cartesian-closed-class — ZFC Cartesian Closed Class","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-cartesian.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-class.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-closed.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-cartesian-closed-class"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-cartesian-closed-class</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-cartesian-closed-class — ZFC Cartesian Closed Class"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"445e1cd0bb5274eb\" href=\"?note=445e1cd0bb5274eb\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-cartesian.md\">../batch18/58-df-cartesian.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" href=\"?note=ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-class.md\">../batch11/58-df-class.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bef75a54dc1e374b\" href=\"?note=bef75a54dc1e374b\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-closed.md\">../batch16/58-df-closed.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> (definable class of sets in the two-sorted metatheory)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Class}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Class}_S\\)</span> (definable-class predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" href=\"?note=ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-class.md\">../batch11/58-df-class.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CartesianClosedClass}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CartesianClosedClass}_S\\)</span> (class-level predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cartesian\\text{-}closed\\text{-}class} \\vdash \\mathrm{CartesianClosedClass}_S(C) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Class}_S(C)\\land\\{\\emptyset\\}\\in C\\land\\forall x,y\\in C\\;(x\\times y\\in C\\land y^x\\in C)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cartesian\\text{-}closed\\text{-}class} \\vdash \\mathrm{CartesianClosedClass}_S(C) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Class}_S(C)\\land\\{\\emptyset\\}\\in C\\land\\forall x,y\\in C\\;(x\\times y\\in C\\land y^x\\in C)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The class guard now uses the exact upstream two-sorted predicate <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Class}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Class}_S\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> is not quantified as a set.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-cartesian.md","status":"resolved","id":"445e1cd0bb5274eb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-cartesian.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-class.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca2a9c9166fa8cce","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-class.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-closed.md","status":"resolved","id":"bef75a54dc1e374b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-closed.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-class.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca2a9c9166fa8cce","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Class}_S$ (definable-class predicate, see [[../batch11/58-df-class.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Class}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CartesianClosedClass}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cartesian\\text{-}closed\\text{-}class} \\vdash \\mathrm{CartesianClosedClass}_S(C) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Class}_S(C)\\land\\{\\emptyset\\}\\in C\\land\\forall x,y\\in C\\;(x\\times y\\in C\\land y^x\\in C)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Class}_S","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false}],"bytes":1050,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1554","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-cartesian-closed-class.md|58-df-zfc-cartesian-closed-class]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","445e1cd0bb5274eb","ca2a9c9166fa8cce","bef75a54dc1e374b"]}